OL,3,GNEWSA'My boss stabbed me then left
OL,4,Aprison early, but no one told me for
OL,5,Amonths'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHannah Pritchett was 18 when she was
OL,8,Fstabbed in the lower back and hip by
OL,9,Fher boss Luisa Santos.
OL,11,FShe was about an hour into her
OL,12,Fwaitressing shift in May 2022 at the
OL,13,FThree Horseshoes pub in Princethorpe,
OL,14,FWarwickshire, when the blade went in.
OL,15,FIt was a fish knife, and with its cuts
OL,16,Fcame Santos's false accusation the teen
OL,17,Fhad had an affair with her husband.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
