OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'My boss stabbed me then left
OL,4,Aprison early, but no one told me for
OL,5,Amonths'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThat October, Santos was jailed for 10
OL,8,Fyears after being convicted of
OL,9,Fattempted murder. She was released in
OL,10,FJanuary 2026 under the Early Removal
OL,11,FScheme, which allows foreign national
OL,12,Finmates in England and Wales, under
OL,13,Fcertain criteria, to exit prison before
OL,14,Fthey would have previously been allowed
OL,15,Ffor the purpose of deportation.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
PN,35303
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1790868350
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'My boss stabbed me then left
OL,4,Aprison early, but no one told me for
OL,5,Amonths'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPritchett did not know of her
OL,8,Fattacker's departure from prison until
OL,9,Ffive months after the fact. Sharing
OL,10,Fwith the BBC the scheme's effect on
OL,11,Fher, she said she had been made to feel
OL,12,Flike an "afterthought", which was "just
OL,13,Fappalling".
